additions.detail:
askBounds counts mid volume as stated (shared/flows-flowlab.js:162, sided = ask + bid + mid) and leaves it out of the upper bound (line 164). leanOf then calls sellers whenever ask + none is under half (line 174).

Worked case: a call with 40% at the ask, 30% at the bid and 30% at the mid.
- Flow Lab prints a zero-width range of 40% to 40%, stated 100%, lean Down: sellers, although buyers outnumber them.
- The site's leanRead gives 40% to 70%, coverage 70%, undetermined.

Fix:
- sided = ask + bid;
- the coverage gate runs on (ask + bid) / vol;
- hi = (vol - bid) / vol;
- Down only when 2 x bid > vol.

This also makes the AGENTS.md Flow Lab row true ('a side that is unknown widens the range and never moves it'). Reproduce with `node <scratchpad>/chal-calc/lean.mjs <checkout root>`.
